    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A bar of poured scrap with four finger holes, filed smooth where it matters and nowhere else. Most of Bad Eden's brawlers carry a pair in a coat pocket for the same reason they carry a coat: the weather turns. They make a fist count for a little more without making it anything other than a fist.</p><p><b>Standard Issue.</b> Swung with <em>Brawl</em> — the hand-to-hand weapon for Stewards who fight up close and never trained with a blade.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Rolls Brawl, not Melee. Concealable. No signature ability.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d6 Kinetic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(bludgeon)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Violence</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Brawl (Violence)</li>\n  <li><strong>Reach:</strong> Melee</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T1</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->"
    }
